<rml><head><link type="text/rcss" href="../MaterialEffects/Lab.rcss" /></head><body><div id="lab"><p class="eyebrow">FORGE / UI MATERIALS</p><h1>One Shader. Two Materials.</h1><p>UVs, presentation time and element size feed these graph-authored textured gradients.</p><div class="comparison"><div class="card"><h2>Still</h2><div class="clip"><div id="still" style='decorator:shader("material:29a4aa8a-d7a5-4370-a1ef-72fd68330238");' /></div><p>Speed 0 / normal UVs</p></div><div class="card"><h2>Motion</h2><div class="clip"><div id="motion" style='decorator:shader("material:e03984b3-427d-4ec8-b574-4f7e0aa2c586");' /></div><p>Speed 0.25 / flipped UVs / opacity 75%</p></div></div><p>Stop Play. Open Still.material.json or Motion.material.json in Content. Change Motion speed, Tint or image UVs, Save, then restart Play.</p><p>Presentation time continues while simulation is paused. No C++ module is required.</p></div></body></rml>
